[en.FOCUS_C04_EMPIRE_TUMOR]
Empire’s Tumor

[en.FOCUS_C04_EMPIRE_TUMOR_desc]
After the Cloudsdale Chamber of Commerce was founded by the Empire, the “Free Cloudsdale Movement” moved to Stratusburg, evolving into the “Free Stratusburg Movement”. Since then, the Stratusburg has become the fortress of liberals and harmonists, or from Empire’s perspective, the Empire’s Tumor. Even after Duchess Derpy replaced the Chamber of Commerce, the harmonists such as the former members of the Wonderbolt did not return to Cloudsdale, but stayed in Stratusburg.\nStratusburg has never fiercely resisted the Empire to force the Empire to send troops, but it has never been a loyal subject of the Empire. Serving as the “thorn” in the Empire’s territory provides a relatively safe haven for the harmonists and Cloudsdale liberals, and provides a rather terrible example among the Empire’s territories. Therefore, independence may not be the most urgent need of Stratusburg. Perhaps how to continue to be a good parasite of the Empire is more important. Spitfire and other former Wonderbolts do not quite agree with this, but the public of the Stratusburg is staisfied with the status quo.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_EMPIRE_TUMOR]
帝国的肿瘤

[zh.FOCUS_C04_EMPIRE_TUMOR_desc]
自帝国建立云中城商业委员会成立后，“自由云中城运动”转战至层云堡，演变为“自由层云堡运动”。从那时起，层云堡就成为了自由派与谐律派的堡垒，也成为了帝国的肿瘤。后来呆蹄领主取代商业委员会后，前闪电天马队员等谐律派也没有再回到云中城，而是留在了层云堡。\n层云堡从未激烈地反抗帝国迫使帝国出兵，但也从未是帝国的忠实臣民。担任帝国领地中的“刺头”角色为层云堡谐律派与云中城自由派提供了一个相对安全的避风港，并为小马利亚帝国领地们提供了一个相当糟糕的示范。因此，独立或许不是层云堡最急切的需求，如何继续做好帝国的寄生虫也许才是层云堡更重要的问题。喷火等前闪电天马队员并不太认同这一点，但层云堡的民众似乎对现状还算满意。

